WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:08.500
What a beautiful planet,
a place we always dreamed about.

00:00:08.580 --> 00:00:09.790
Earth.

00:00:09.870 --> 00:00:10.960
A NETFLIX
DOUBLE FEATURE FILM

00:00:11.790 --> 00:00:15.000
The power of all the nightmares
we have accumulated

00:00:15.090 --> 00:00:19.050
will turn this world
into a planet of death!

00:00:19.670 --> 00:00:20.550
Mamo-chan!

00:00:20.630 --> 00:00:22.220
My chest… What was that?

00:00:22.970 --> 00:00:24.180
Beautiful maiden.

00:00:24.260 --> 00:00:27.060
Save our existence
from this nightmare!

00:00:27.140 --> 00:00:27.970
FOR LOVE AND JUSTICE

00:00:28.060 --> 00:00:31.640
And it seems the more you hesitate,
the deeper they can get into your heart.

00:00:33.310 --> 00:00:34.520
THE ENTIRE
DREAM ARC

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:37.860
We'll sell nightmares
all over the world.

00:00:39.530 --> 00:00:41.530
PRESENTED IN
TWO FILMS

00:00:41.610 --> 00:00:44.950
Protecting this planet.
That's always been our truth.

00:00:45.740 --> 00:00:47.120
Attack!

00:00:51.870 --> 00:00:53.210
We can't give up.

00:01:00.380 --> 00:01:02.970
You won't defeat my curse.

00:01:06.680 --> 00:01:08.850
We have to fight, no matter what.

00:01:09.770 --> 00:01:13.480
I am one who sleeps within you.
A memory, you might say.

00:01:14.270 --> 00:01:15.730
And it's time to wake up.

00:01:23.240 --> 00:01:26.320
Don't forget, this was only the premiere
of the Dead Moon Circus.

00:01:26.410 --> 00:01:27.660
We've only just begun.

00:01:27.740 --> 00:01:28.830
TO PROTECT
THE WORLD

00:01:29.280 --> 00:01:30.410
AND THOSE WE
HOLD DEAR

00:01:30.830 --> 00:01:32.700
BEAUTIFUL DREAMS
WILL BE REBORN ETERNAL

00:01:32.790 --> 00:01:34.920
Sailor Planet Power!

00:01:35.250 --> 00:01:38.130
PRETTY GUARDIAN SAILOR MOON
ETERNAL THE MOVIE

00:01:38.210 --> 00:01:40.300
In the name of the Moon,

00:01:40.380 --> 00:01:42.920
I, Sailor Moon, will punish you!

